empsit_05082026.pdf","https://www.bls.gov/news.release/archives/empsit_06052026.pdf","https://www.bls.gov/news.release/archives/empsit_07022026.pdf","https://www.bls.gov/schedule/news_release/empsit.htm?categoryId=1&orient=1"],"runAt":"2026-07-21T01:13:26Z","reasoning":[{"kind":"heading","text":"July 2026 CPS transportation and material-moving employment forecast"},{"kind":"text","text":"The resolver is BLS CPS Table A-19, Transportation and material moving occupations, Total age 16+, not seasonally adjusted, first July 2026 print in thousands converted to millions. This is distinct from seasonally adjusted establishment-survey transportation and warehousing payrolls."},{"kind":"tool","tool":"official.lookup","call":"Read the current BLS CPS Table A-19 and June 2026 Employment Situation archive.","result":"BLS reports 12,010 thousand transportation and material-moving workers in June 2026 versus 11,619 thousand in June 2025; total CPS employment was 162,722 thousand in June 2026."},{"kind":"tool","tool":"official.lookup","call":"Read archived March and April 2026 Employment Situation occupation tables.","result":"The first-print transportation and material-moving employment values were 12,214 thousand in March 2026 and 12,127 thousand in April 2026; the corresponding prior-year values were 11,958 thousand and 12,059 thousand."},{"kind":"tool","tool":"official.lookup","call":"Read the archived May 2026 Employment Situation occupation table.","result":"The May 2026 first print was 12,120 thousand, compared with 11,742 thousand in May 2025; BLS also reported May transportation-and-warehousing payroll employment changed by +1,000."},{"kind":"tool","tool":"official.lookup","call":"Verify the July 2026 Employment Situation date on the official BLS release calendar and June release notice.","result":"Both official BLS sources schedule the July 2026 Employment Situation for August 7, 2026 at 8:30 a.m. ET; this is 1 day later than the registered 2026-08-06 resolutionDate."},